        "original_id": "50794eb1-06ab-5e2e-a760-2c59322a0668",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Cepello, Jesse Ventura, Mark Dayton\n- Roles: Governor of Minnesota, wrestler, artist\n- Places: Minnesota, Governor's Mansion, Minnesota State Capitol\n- Organizations: Democratic-Farmer-Labor Party\n\nFacts:\n- After retiring from wrestling to focus on his art career, Stephen Cepello was selected to paint the official Governor's Mansion and Minnesota State Capitol portraits of Jesse Ventura.\n- Jesse Ventura was a former wrestler and Governor of Minnesota.\n- Mark Dayton of the Democratic-Farmer-Labor Party was the current governor of Minnesota.",
